---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Execution Support" description="Strategic execution without the overhead. GreaterThan scopes the brief, sources the right people, and sees it through to completion.">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero hero--sub section--indigo">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Layer 2 / Execution Support</span>
    <h1>Strategic execution without the overhead</h1>
    <p class="lead">Your strategy is clear. Now you need to deliver it. That might mean a campaign, a rebrand, a new website, or AI integration. You need someone who can scope it right, find the right people to build it, and see it through to completion.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT'S INCLUDED -->
<section class="service-detail-layout">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="included-section">
      <h2 class="reveal">What's<br />included</h2>
      <ul class="included-list reveal d1">
        <li>Strategic brief development</li>
        <li>Resource sourcing</li>
        <li>Vendor management</li>
        <li>Creative oversight</li>
        <li>Project management</li>
        <li>Quality control</li>
        <li>Internal capability building</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->
    <div class="who-section">
      <h2 class="reveal">Who it's for</h2>
      <div class="who-grid">
        <div class="who-card reveal">
          <h3>Established businesses</h3>
          <p>You know what you want but don't want to manage vendors yourselves.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who-card reveal d1">
          <h3>Consultants or leaders scaling up</h3>
          <p>You need execution support, but you can't yet justify hiring a full in-house team.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who-card reveal d2">
          <h3>Businesses with strategy needing delivery</h3>
          <p>You know the direction, but the briefs aren't clear and you're not sure who should do the work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
<section class="testimonials-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="reveal">What clients say</h2>
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <div class="testimonial-card reveal">
        <p>"The project management and oversight GreaterThan brought meant we could focus on the business while the rebrand was executed exactly to brief. The outcome exceeded what we imagined possible."</p>
        <cite>
          <strong>Client Name</strong>
          Title, Company
        </cite>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card reveal d1">
        <p>"We had a clear direction but couldn't find the right people to execute it. Andrew sourced and managed the whole project. It came in on time, on budget, and better than we hoped."</p>
        <cite>
          <strong>Client Name</strong>
          Title, Company
        </cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band__inner">
      <h2>Ready to turn strategy into <em>results</em>?</h2>
      <div class="cta-band__right">
        <span class="cta-band__email">hello@wearegreaterthan.co.nz</span>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary-dark">Book a discovery call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
